---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Yukta customer story: invoice processing in about 20 seconds — Algorims"
  description="See how Yukta Pte Ltd uses a Claude-powered accounts-payable pipeline built by Algorims to process invoices in about 20 seconds, with review for exceptions."
>
  <article class="story">
    <header class="hero container-x">
      <div class="hero-top"><p class="eyebrow">Customer story <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> Yukta Pte Ltd</p></div>
      <div class="hero-main">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="customer-name"><img src="/assets/customer-stories/yukta-property-icon.svg" width="40" height="40" alt="" />YUKTA <span>PTE LTD</span></p>
          <h1>Less time on invoices. <em>More time for the work that matters.</em></h1>
          <span class="hero-spark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-note"><span>The shift ↘</span><p class="lede">A Singapore finance team turned a multilingual, manual process into an accounts-payable workflow that handles routine invoices in about 20 seconds.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-footer"><span>Financial services</span><span>Singapore</span><a href="#story">Read Yukta’s story <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
    </header>

    <section class="voice" aria-label="Customer perspective">
      <div class="container-x voice-inner">
        <span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
        <figure>
          <blockquote>Claude now reads our invoices the moment they land in our inbox, and our team only steps in when something actually needs a human.</blockquote>
          <figcaption><strong>Sravan</strong><span>Tech Lead, Yukta Pte Ltd</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="story" class="story-section container-x" aria-labelledby="before-title">
      <div class="section-label"><span>01</span><p>Before</p></div>
      <div class="section-content"><h2 id="before-title">An inbox full of invoices. A ledger filled by hand.</h2><p>Yukta’s finance team keyed every supplier invoice and receipt into the ledger by hand. Each document took 15–30 minutes to process across English, Bahasa and Chinese.</p><p>Template-based OCR broke when a new layout arrived, and errors often surfaced only at month-end.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section class="shift container-x" aria-label="Before and after invoice processing">
      <figure class="shift-scene">
        <div class="scene-art"><img src="/assets/customer-stories/yukta-before.webp" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" alt="Invoices and receipts pass through a manual review step before they reach the ledger." /></div>
        <figcaption><span>Before / Manual entry</span><strong>15–30 min</strong><p>Each invoice or receipt was keyed into the ledger by hand.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <span class="shift-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <figure class="shift-scene">
        <div class="scene-art"><img src="/assets/customer-stories/yukta-after.webp" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" alt="Invoices flow into a central AI platform, then branch to approved records or exceptions for human review." /></div>
        <figcaption><span>After / AI with human review</span><strong>~20 sec</strong><p>Routine invoices post automatically; exceptions reach a reviewer.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="story-section container-x" aria-labelledby="change-title">
      <div class="section-label"><span>02</span><p>What changed</p></div>
      <div class="section-content"><h2 id="change-title">Let the routine work move. Keep people in the loop.</h2><p>Algorims built and deployed an accounts-payable pipeline with Claude at its core. It has run in production on AWS Singapore since September 2026.</p><p>Claude reads each emailed invoice, extracts and validates its fields, and scores its confidence in one step. High-confidence invoices post directly to the ledger. The remaining invoices go to a finance reviewer. Both paths retain a full audit trail.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section class="outcomes" aria-labelledby="outcomes-title"><div class="container-x">
      <div class="outcomes-heading"><p class="eyebrow">At a glance</p><h2 id="outcomes-title">A lighter day for finance.</h2></div>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>~20 sec</dt><dd>To process an invoice, down from 15–30 minutes by hand</dd></div>
        <div><dt>65%</dt><dd>Of invoices posted without human intervention</dd></div>
        <div><dt>200 / month</dt><dd>Invoices and receipts across three languages</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div></section>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .story { color: hsl(var(--foreground)); }
  .hero { padding-top: clamp(40px, 6vw, 82px); }
  .hero-top, .hero-footer { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; }
  .hero-top { padding-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0; color: hsl(var(--primary)); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .eyebrow span { margin-inline: 6px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }
  .hero-main { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.45fr .55fr; align-items: end; gap: clamp(36px, 6vw, 100px); padding: clamp(56px, 8vw, 112px) 0 clamp(52px, 7vw, 96px); }
  .hero-copy { position: relative; animation: rise-in .75s both cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .2, 1); }
  .customer-name { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 0 0 26px; padding: 8px 16px 8px 8px; border: 1px solid #0b4a66; border-radius: 999px; background: #fff; color: #0b4a66; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .customer-name img { display: block; width: 40px; height: 40px; flex: none; border-radius: 12px; }
  .customer-name span { color: #30363d; font-weight: 700; }
  h1 { max-width: 900px; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 6.2vw, 6rem); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.067em; line-height: 1.02; text-wrap: balance; }
  h1 em { color: hsl(var(--primary)); font-style: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: hsl(var(--primary) / .25); text-decoration-thickness: .085em; text-underline-offset: .09em; }
  .hero-spark { position: absolute; top: 3%; right: -4%; color: hsl(var(--primary)); font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem); line-height: 1; animation: spark-in 1.2s both cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .2, 1), spark-bob 4s 1.2s infinite ease-in-out; }
  @keyframes spark-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: rotate(-65deg) scale(.6); } to { opacity: 1; transform: rotate(-15deg) scale(1); } }
  @keyframes spark-bob { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-15deg); } 50% { transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(0deg); } }
  @keyframes rise-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  .intro-note { padding: 20px 0 6px 23px; border-left: 2px solid hsl(var(--primary)); transform: rotate(2deg); animation: note-in .8s .18s both cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .2, 1); }
  @keyframes note-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px) rotate(2deg); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) rotate(2deg); } }
  .intro-note > span { color: hsl(var(--primary)); font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .lede { max-width: 360px; margin: 0 0 8px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.45vw, 1.3rem); line-height: 1.65; }
  .intro-note .lede { margin-top: 14px; }
  .hero-footer { padding: 18px 0; border-top: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; animation: rise-in .7s .35s both cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .2, 1); }
  .hero-footer a { margin-left: auto; color: hsl(var(--primary)); }
  .voice { position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: hsl(var(--primary) / .06); border-block: 1px solid hsl(var(--primary) / .16); }
  .voice::after { position: absolute; right: -160px; bottom: -290px; width: 620px; height: 620px; border: 1px solid hsl(var(--primary) / .14); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 65px hsl(var(--primary) / .035), 0 0 0 130px hsl(var(--primary) / .025); content: ""; pointer-events: none; }
  .voice-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr; gap: clamp(20px, 5vw, 80px); padding-top: clamp(70px, 9vw, 130px); padding-bottom: clamp(70px, 9vw, 130px); }
  .quote-mark { color: hsl(var(--primary)); font-size: 8rem; font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: .8; }
  .voice figure { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 960px; margin: 0; }
  blockquote { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 3.8rem); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.05em; line-height: 1.25; text-wrap: balance; }
  .voice figcaption { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 34px; font-size: .9rem; }
  .voice figcaption span { color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }
  .story-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .4fr 1fr; gap: clamp(32px, 7vw, 96px); padding-block: clamp(52px, 7vw, 96px); }
  .section-label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding-top: 8px; color: hsl(var(--primary)); font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .section-label span { display: grid; width: 42px; height: 42px; flex: none; place-items: center; border: 1px solid hsl(var(--primary) / .35); border-radius: 50%; transform: rotate(-12deg); }
  .section-label p { margin: 0; }
  .section-content { max-width: 730px; }
  .section-content h2 { margin: 0 0 36px; font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.3vw, 4.4rem); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.055em; line-height: 1.08; text-wrap: balance; }
  .section-content p { max-width: 640px; margin: 0; color: hsl(var(--foreground) / .78); font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .section-content p + p { margin-top: 22px; }
  .shift { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
  .shift-scene { min-width: 0; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius: 18px; background: hsl(var(--background)); }
  .scene-art { overflow: hidden; border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); background: hsl(var(--primary) / .025); }
  .scene-art img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .shift-scene figcaption { display: grid; gap: 8px; min-height: 160px; padding: 22px 26px 26px; }
  .shift-scene figcaption span { color: hsl(var(--primary)); font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .shift-scene figcaption strong { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.055em; line-height: 1; }
  .shift-scene figcaption p { max-width: 360px; margin: 0; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .shift-arrow { position: absolute; z-index: 1; top: 27%; left: 50%; display: grid; width: 52px; height: 52px; place-items: center; border: 1px solid hsl(var(--primary)); border-radius: 50%; background: hsl(var(--background)); color: hsl(var(--primary)); font-size: 1.7rem; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-25deg); }
  .outcomes { padding: clamp(70px, 9vw, 120px) 0; border-block: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); background: hsl(var(--primary) / .035); }
  .outcomes-heading { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 42px; }
  .outcomes h2 { max-width: 650px; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 4rem); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.055em; line-height: 1.1; }
  .outcomes dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin: 0; }
  .outcomes dl div { min-height: 210px; padding: 26px; border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius: 16px; background: hsl(var(--background)); }
  .outcomes dl div:nth-child(2) { border-color: hsl(var(--primary) / .3); background: hsl(var(--primary) / .08); transform: translateY(14px) rotate(1.5deg); }
  .outcomes dt { color: hsl(var(--primary)); font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.7rem); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.055em; line-height: 1.1; }
  .outcomes dd { max-width: 260px; margin: 12px 0 0; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: .92rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .hero-footer a span { display: inline-block; transition: transform .25s ease; }
  .hero-footer a:hover span { transform: translateY(4px); }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .hero-main { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .hero-spark { right: 0; }
    .intro-note { max-width: 650px; transform: none; animation-name: rise-in; }
    .lede { max-width: 650px; }
    .voice-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
    .quote-mark { font-size: 5rem; }
    .story-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero-spark { top: -12px; font-size: 3rem; }
    .hero-footer { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .hero-footer a { width: 100%; margin: 8px 0 0; }
    .shift { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; }
    .shift-arrow { top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(65deg); }
    .outcomes-heading { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    .outcomes dl { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
    .outcomes dl div:nth-child(2) { transform: rotate(1deg); }
  }
  @supports (animation-timeline: view()) {
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .voice-inner, .story-section, .shift, .outcomes-heading, .outcomes dl { animation: scroll-in linear both; animation-timeline: view(); animation-range: entry 0% entry 28%; }
      @keyframes scroll-in { from { opacity: .55; translate: 0 24px; } to { opacity: 1; translate: 0 0; } }
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-copy, .intro-note, .hero-footer, .hero-spark { animation: none; }
    .hero-spark { transform: rotate(-15deg); }
    .hero-footer a span { transition: none; }
    .hero-footer a:hover span { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
